23.18.179.m:
He gives a white horse;
he gives a white mare;
he gives a black horse;

he gives a pregnant mare having a mark on the forehead;
he gives a hundred draft-oxen;
he gives thirty-three golden ornaments;

23.19.181.m:
As to the hall:
One should measure it with the ordinary pace;
the gārhapatya fire is in the middle: —
